# Canonical author identity.
#
# Only a display name now. The two addresses this file used to map - a personal one and a
# GitHub noreply - no longer appear anywhere in this repository: D49 added this mailmap so
# the history would read as one author WITHOUT rewriting commits, and D55 then rewrote them
# anyway, because the repository was going public and a personal address in 160 commits is
# not something a later decision can take back.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> <other@email>
# A line with no second address sets the canonical NAME for that address.

